      "reason": "Relay groups remained partitioned, then rejoined through a restarted P23. Two events published out of order reconciled once at R4 without duplicate IDs."
    },
    {
      "case": "G05-05",
      "status": "PASS",
      "reason": "Three non-recipient bridge identities did not forward B’s envelope. B’s real PWA bridge forwarded only B’s recipient wrap to B’s inbox; A’s sender copy followed A’s inbox when A was the bridge identity."
    },
    {
      "case": "G05-06",
      "status": "PASS",
      "reason": "UI toggle stopped and resumed the real PWA bridge. Fixed-input checks verified source exclusion, ID deduplication, signature/age boundaries, a 60-of-61 event batch and UTF-8 byte-based containment above 2 MB."
    },
    {
      "case": "G05-07",
      "status": "PASS",
      "reason": "Closing the mobile-sized browser context stopped its bridge while both independent Geode relays remained available; a reopened context resumed forwarding. This is desktop viewport emulation only and does not certify physical mobile suspension/background behavior."
    }
